Title: Salisbury woman completes 200-mile challenge on 100th birthday
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Phyll Babb', 'Text': "It's hard to believe I've done 200 walks. It's gone like a dream.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 39, 'EndChar': 97}}, {'Speaker': 'Phyll Babb', 'Text': '"Walking is good for you," she said. "I was brought up to walk, so as children we walked everywhere, and I still like walking."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 118}}, {'Speaker': 'Phyll Babb', 'Text': '"It\'s been delightful. I\'ve had a ball actually."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 12, 'EndChar': 55}}, {'Speaker': 'David Evans', 'Text': '"To reach the age of 100 and to do it so fit, looking so well, being so articulate, that\'s the really amazing thing she\'s done."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 24, 'EndChar': 122}}, {'Speaker': 'Liz Huntley', 'Text': '"She is inspirational, definitely. She\'s been inspirational my whole life, to be honest,"', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 87}}, {'Speaker': 'Ruth Simmons', 'Text': '"Seeing my great aunt complete her 200th lap around the cathedral has been really special."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 83}}, {'Speaker': 'Phyll Babb', 'Text': '"He looked at every 20 walks I did, which I recorded on Strava on my mobile phone, and then he confirmed them in a little book," she said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 141}}, {'Speaker': 'Gordon Pardy', 'Text': '"We bought a house recently, and so the money that Phyll has raised will go towards furnishing the house," he said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 16, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 117}}, {'Speaker': 'Gordon Pardy', 'Text': '"To do this in her 100th year was so impressive," he added.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 48}}, {'Speaker': 'Phyll Babb', 'Text': 'Ms Babb said people had been "extremely generous" and said "thank you all very, very much".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 18, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 81}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'A woman says she "had a ball" completing a 200-mile (322km) walking challenge in her hundredth year.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 83}}, {'Description': 'Phyll Babb, from Salisbury in Wiltshire, reached the finish line on Sunday, her 100th birthday, raising more than £11,000 for Salisbury Trust for the Homeless (STFH).', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 143}}, {'Description': 'She had planned to walk 100 miles (161km), but doubled her target in January after realising she was ahead of schedule.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 96}}, {'Description': 'Completing the final mile around Salisbury Cathedral, Ms Babb said: "It\'s hard to believe I\'ve done 200 walks. It\'s gone like a dream."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 97}}, {'Description': 'Ms Babb was cheered on by members of her family, who said she was an inspiration.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 74}}, {'Description': 'A local accountant and supporter of the charity had helped Ms Babb log her walks.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 13, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 74}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Phyll Babb, wearing a beige and blue outfit and sunglasses and with short white hair, smiling, while leading a walk. There are people behind her holding a banner for Salisbury Trust for the Homeless.'}]}
